acceptableUse.body:
You agree not to:

- upload unlawful content, or personal data you have no basis to hold;
- attempt to access another organization's data, or probe, scan or test our security without written permission;
- interfere with or overload the service;
- reverse engineer or resell the service; or
- use the service to send unsolicited messages.

whatHappens.body:
When you delete your RootEd account, we permanently remove:

- your name, phone number and profile photo;
- your email address, which is replaced by a placeholder that can never receive mail;
- your username;
- your password and your two-factor authentication secret;
- every pending invitation, verification and password-reset token; and
- your membership of every organization.

All your sessions are revoked immediately and you cannot sign in again. This cannot be undone.
